{
	"_note": "Calendar of Blood. cohort_signals: [{id, cohort, when, text}], the Priestess's cycle notices; when is a GameClock.matches_when block. schedules: npc_id -> [{when, location, activity}], first entry whose when holds wins (GameClock.schedule_for). places: location -> {name, scene, spot, where}: scene is the res:// map for the location (null: no map, the NPC is away indoors and absent from every map), spot the Marker2D on that map (null: the NPC's own scene position; %s in the name is filled with the npc_id, per-NPC spots), where a short phrase for hint text. schedule_hold: npc_id -> {until_any: [flag, ...]}: while none of the flags is set the NPC keeps the village (her home spot) whatever the schedule says. The Initiate opens the Offering quest, so she holds her village spot until the player has answered her (quest_offering_accepted or refused_offering); this keeps the first minutes unchanged. New text is DRAFT (_draft).",
	"cohort_signals": [
		{ "id": "gate_opens", "cohort": "first", "when": { "cycle_day_min": 1, "cycle_day_max": 3 },
		  "text": "The first cohort's Gate has opened. By the Covenant's count, a new cycle begins today." },
		{ "id": "womb_calls", "cohort": "all", "when": { "cycle_day_min": 4, "cycle_day_max": 6 },
		  "text": "The cohorts are aligned. The womb calls. The rites are held, and the drones are brought in." },
		{ "id": "training_days", "cohort": "second", "when": { "cycle_day_min": 7, "cycle_day_max": 11 },
		  "text": "Second cohort chants for the initiates. Training days: texts, blood-art, memorization." },
		{ "id": "fourteenth_eve", "cohort": "all", "when": { "days_until_festival": 1 },
		  "text": "The cohorts fast and sing. The Festival of the Fourteenth is tomorrow, by the cohort's count." },
		{ "id": "festival_of_the_fourteenth", "cohort": "all", "when": { "festival": true },
		  "text": "The Fourteenth. The cohorts rise as one. Offerings are made and the Mothers are praised." },
		{ "id": "quiet_after", "cohort": "third", "when": { "cycle_day_min": 15, "cycle_day_max": 20 },
		  "text": "Quiet days. The cohort does not discuss what the rites did or did not accomplish." },
		{ "id": "sacred_weeks", "cohort": "all", "when": { "cycle_day_min": 21, "cycle_day_max": 27 },
		  "text": "The sacred weeks. Visions, weeping and fury are holy. Do not interrupt a vision." },
		{ "id": "gate_closing", "cohort": "all", "when": { "cycle_day": 28 },
		  "text": "The Gate is nearly shut. The cohort waits for the next to open. The count will drift again." }
	],
